[00:24.70]On many occasions God spoke to men
[00:30.24]By means of his prophets of old.
[00:36.38]Today he is saying, ‘Let all repent,’
[00:42.84]By God’s own Son we are told.
[00:48.19](Chorus)
[00:48.34]Do we have strong faith? Is it real?
[00:54.26]We must build such faith to survive.
[01:00.38]Is our faith proved true by our works?
[01:06.06]By means of faith, we’ll be preserved alive.
[01:21.28]We gladly obey Christ Jesus’ command
[01:27.68]To share Kingdom truth far and wide.
[01:33.38]We boldly declare God’s message of hope;
[01:39.74]His promise we’ll never hide.
[01:45.21](Chorus)
[01:45.36]Do we have strong faith? Is it real?
[01:51.26]We must build such faith to survive.
[01:57.34]Is our faith proved true by our works?
[02:03.08]By means of faith, we’ll be preserved alive.
[02:08.62]Our faith is an anchor firm and secure;
[02:36.76]We never will shrink back in fear.
[02:42.34]Our trust in Jehovah helps us endure;
[02:48.76]We know salvation is near.
[02:54.17](Chorus)
[02:54.32]Do we have strong faith? Is it real?
[02:59.88]We must build such faith to survive.
[03:06.06]Is our faith proved true by our works?
[03:11.96]By means of faith, we’ll be preserved alive.
